<title>PHILIPPINES: Solidbank gets SEC approval on capital hike.</title>
<headline>Solidbank gets SEC approval on capital hike.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Solidbank Corp said on Thursday the Securities and Exchange Commission approved the increase in its authorised capital stock to 3.2 billion pesos from 2.2 billion pesos.</p>
<p>It also cleared the bank's 100 percent stock dividend declaration. The record date for the stock dividend was September 19, 1996. - Manila newsroom 63 2 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
